      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Clinical manifestations and diagnostic methods of particular anatomical variants of intestinal rotation and fixation disorders were discussed by the authors in 208 children of different age groups. There was revealed the tendency to reduce rotation abnormalities diversity with the increase of age group. At the same time the frequency of occurrence of the colon fixation anomalies characterized by chronic recurrent process and progressing colostasis was enlarged."},
